WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.900
Hello, I'm Richard
from You Can Education

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.100
and I want to invite you to the
22nd Anglia International Conference

3
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:10.000
in Buenos Aires on September 5th.

4
00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:14.300
I'll be delivering a talk
about brain-friendly teaching.

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.700
I'll give you lots of tips that will
make your teaching more successful.

6
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:21.300
So, I want to see you there.

7
00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:24.500
I will be at 9:15,
the initial talk,

8
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.300
and it's going to be great to meet
people from all around the country

9
00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:31.600
and abroad, sharing
experience and knowledge.

10
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:33.300
Bye! See you!
